# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime data. NEVER commit this folder.
#
# It holds the SQLite database (your leads and their contact details), uploaded
# CSVs, generated exports and audit reports, logs, and data/config/*.json -
# which contains YOUR identity (name, email, WhatsApp number) and any API keys
# you enter in Settings.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/

# Local machine configuration (ports). Ship .env.example instead.
